sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff member
    participant UI as Messages UI
    participant API as LHIMS API
    participant Auth as Authentication and permissions
    participant Val as Request validation
    participant Svc as Messaging service
    participant DB as Tenant database

    Staff->>UI: Open Department messages
    UI->>API: GET /api/messages/channels
    API->>Auth: Authenticate and require MESSAGES_READ
    Auth-->>API: Staff identity and facility context
    API->>Svc: Resolve channels and recipients
    Svc->>DB: Remove expired rows and count unexpired group rows
    DB-->>Svc: Counts where recipientDepartment is null
    Svc-->>API: Role-visible channels and own department
    Svc-->>API: Other departments excluding own department
    API-->>UI: 200 success envelope

    Staff->>UI: Select recipient department
    UI->>API: GET /api/messages/departments/FINANCE?limit=100
    API->>Auth: Authenticate and require MESSAGES_READ
    API->>Val: Validate department key and limit
    Val-->>API: Valid request
    API->>Svc: Read selected department thread
    Svc->>Svc: Derive own department from authenticated role
    Svc->>Svc: Reject unmapped role or self-directed target
    Svc->>DB: Query both sender-recipient directions
    DB-->>Svc: Unexpired pair messages in current facility
    Svc-->>API: Thread messages ordered oldest first
    API-->>UI: 200 success envelope
    UI->>UI: Render labeled keyboard-focusable message log

    loop Every 15 seconds while thread is active
        UI->>API: GET /api/messages/departments/FINANCE?limit=100
        API->>Auth: Authenticate and require MESSAGES_READ
        API->>Svc: Re-read only this department pair
        Svc->>DB: Filter expiry and apply facility tenant scope
        DB-->>Svc: Current pair messages
        Svc-->>API: Refreshed conversation
        API-->>UI: 200 success envelope
    end

    Staff->>UI: Compose a message. Enter sends. Shift Enter adds a line
    UI->>API: POST /api/messages with recipientDepartment and body
    API->>Auth: Authenticate and require MESSAGES_SEND
    API->>Val: Validate one destination and a body from 1 to 2000 characters
    Val-->>API: Valid request
    API->>Svc: Derive sender department and check recipient
    Svc->>DB: Create message with 24 hour expiry
    DB-->>Svc: Created message with sender summary
    Svc-->>API: New message row
    API-->>UI: 201 success envelope
    UI->>UI: Clear draft and keep keyboard focus
    UI->>API: GET /api/messages/departments/FINANCE?limit=100
    UI->>API: GET /api/messages/channels
    API-->>UI: Updated thread and channel summary

    opt Staff selects a shared channel instead
        UI->>API: GET /api/messages/ALL?limit=100
        API->>Auth: Authenticate and require MESSAGES_READ
        API->>Val: Validate channel and limit
        API->>Svc: Read shared-channel messages
        Svc->>DB: Query unexpired rows where recipientDepartment is null
        DB-->>Svc: Shared-channel messages
        Svc-->>API: Channel messages
        API-->>UI: 200 success envelope
    end
